# Cloudflare Pages Edge Redirect Rules
# Note: Cloudflare Pages _redirects file only supports relative URLs as sources (e.g., /old-path /new-path 301).
# Apex domain redirects (arturonavax.com -> arturonavax.dev, www -> apex, http -> https)
# and subdomain redirects (cv.*, resume.* -> arturonavax.dev/resume)
# are configured at the Cloudflare Zone level via Cloudflare Dashboard -> Rules -> Redirect Rules.

# In-site path aliases to canonical resume routes
/cv /resume 301
/cv/ /resume 301
/es/cv /es/resume 301
/es/cv/ /es/resume 301

